          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teech kwandang’ung’ ak komet, ko u ye king’atin Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’: si kochang’ait betusieguk, ak komieit eng’ inye eng’ emet ne konin Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.16",
